(2003). 法律援助条例（国令第 385 号，第十条、第十一条、第十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2008-03/28/content_6944.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2008-03/28/content_6944.htm"]},"；司法部有关负责人 (2021). 就贯彻实施法律援助法答记者问. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/zhengce/2021-12/29/content_5665114.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/zhengce/2021-12/29/content_5665114.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2008-03/28/content_6944.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["法律扶助法は 2022 年 1 月 1 日から施行されており、一点変更があります。以前は「経済的困難の証明書の提出」が必要でした。現在は、本人が自身の経済状況を事実通りに説明するだけでよくなり、旧住所に戻って証明書を取る必要はなくなりました。窓口は各地の法律扶助センター、公共法律サービスセンター、または 12348 へ電話することでも利用可能です。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/t